OL,3,GNEWSAThe Faslane investment aimed at
OL,4,Amaking Britain 'warfighting ready'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen HMS Vengeance returned to its base
OL,7,Fat Faslane on the Clyde last week, it
OL,8,Fsymbolised the duty and sacrifice of
OL,9,FRoyal Navy's submariners.
OL,11,FThe Vanguard-class submarine, one of
OL,12,Ffour vessels which carry the UK's
OL,13,FTrident nuclear weapons, had spent a
OL,14,Frecord-breaking 217 days submerged at
OL,15,Fsea.
OL,17,FFor submariners, being totally cut off
OL,18,Ffrom loved ones while on deployment is
OL,19,Fnormal but the length of this tour was
OL,20,Funusual.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
