OL,3,GNEWSAThe Faslane investment aimed at
OL,4,Amaking Britain 'warfighting ready'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat's why HMS Vengeance's return
OL,7,Frepresented something other than duty -
OL,8,Fit was a symbol of neglect.
